Z||000007||NEPTUNE||10-01-2001||11:18 AM||||Funny thing about this thread is most of the ricers I meet are genuinely interested in my wierd little Pontiac. I think we really have more in common with the Honda guy who has a small, nimble,fast car with plastic body panels than we do with the Muscle car guys who exclude all cars newer than 1972 from cruises/shows, or the Bubbas in skyscraper trucks.<BR>Even if the new Acura or Honda beats you, 1) it still looks like every other car on the road, and 2) the Fiero is 15 years old. Anyone seen a hot 15 year old Honda?||||reg||1
